# Freelance invoice

// hours and costs as named variables, the bill assembled from them:
// the percent forms do the discount and the tax as relative moves

## The work
design = 14 * 95
integration = 9 * 95
retainer = 1200

## Costs
photos = 45
typeface = 120
costs = photos + typeface

## The bill
// names are single words: two-word names never bind
subtotal = design + integration + retainer + costs
discounted = subtotal - 5%
vat = discounted * 21%
bill = discounted + vat
